  "description": "<p>Introducing the tastiest all-natural vegan plant-shake on the market.</p>\r\n<h3>Our Story</h3>\r\n<p>We set ourselves the challenge to create the tastiest vegan plant-shake on the market - and this is a protein shake like no other. We blended all of the good stuff with three irresistible flavours - Cookies &amp; Cream, Chocolate Brownie and Blueberry Muffin - so you can enjoy your treats with low sugar &amp; calories plus no artificial ingredients.</p>\r\n<p>Our shakes are 100% vegan, combining three different types of plant protein &ndash; fava bean, pumpkin seed and pea protein isolate.&nbsp;<br>- No whey&nbsp;<br>- No dairy&nbsp;<br>- Ready to drink, wherever you are&nbsp;<br>- Fortified with vitamins, minerals and fibre&nbsp;<br>- All natural. No nasties</p>\r\n<p>We started this company because of our belief in one overarching philosophy: believing in yourself without allowing anyone else to limit your success or how far you can go. This is what we stand for and what the foundations of our products are built on. It&rsquo;s also where we got brand our name.</p>",
